<p>SCP-2124 is the pizzabox - because there's not a good way to contain the knives, and they do seem to be connected <em>somehow</em> to the box.</p>
<p>The how-it-was found is meant to be convenient, and I thought about it for a while before deciding I couldn't think of a better way short of having a researcher find it themself. I wanted to imply that there could be hundreds of simple unknown things out there, just locked away in attics. But a better job could've been done, I'm sure.</p>
<p>As for Clarent's behaviour - I could have maybe done that better. I wanted to make it very clear that whatever properties SCP-2124-1 had, it definitely wasn't metaphysical beyond its&#8230; existence, for lack of a better word.</p>

