A human being attempting to consciously&#8230;<br />
[the bullets]<br />
SCP-2124-1 has no detectable weight or measurable presence, &#8230;<br />
Exact dimensions and properties of instances of&#8230;<br />
The interior of SCP-2124 appears to be empty&#8230;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>And the two paragraphs I didn't mention aren't necessary at all.</p>
<p>I've also edited the first few paragraphs and testing logs to add paragraph spacing to them, since consecutive paragraphs should almost always have a blank space in between them if there's any possibility they could be confused for one paragraph.</p>

